    fix: set num_workers=0 and mp.set_sharing_strategy('file_system') to prevent container /dev/shm shared memory exhaustion

diff --git a/research/run_ultimate_multi_day_tournament.py b/research/run_ultimate_multi_day_tournament.py
index 4e1721a..578f839 100644
--- a/research/run_ultimate_multi_day_tournament.py
+++ b/research/run_ultimate_multi_day_tournament.py
